<title>USA: Liberty Bancorp Inc sets Q1 $0.06/shr div.</title>
<headline>Liberty Bancorp Inc sets Q1 $0.06/shr div.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount	  $0.06		     $0.15</p>
<p> Pay	     Feb 9</p>
<p> Record	  Feb 9</p>
<p>Note: Dividend is partial Q1 dividend prior to Liberty Bancorp's merger with Hinsdale Financial Corp, closing in Q1 1997. It is not part of $0.15/shr Q4 payout set Jan 10.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
